{"uid":"2c586c20d83d6b06","name":"test_regular_package_decoy_on_pythonpath_still_resolves_here","fullName":"tests.test_tests_conftest_resolution#test_regular_package_decoy_on_pythonpath_still_resolves_here","historyId":"3a8837a36af53a4852b03f196e6428da","time":{"start":1791916001927,"stop":1791916004043,"duration":2116},"description":"The #64 case, and the one measured in the wild (installed wheels\n    shipping a top-level `tests/` package): the decoy carries\n    `__init__.py`, so it is a *regular* package. `PathFinder` returns it\n    with a loader and stops walking, throwing away this repo's namespace\n    portion -- even though this repo's root is at `sys.path[0]` and the\n    decoy is behind it on `PYTHONPATH`. Ordering is irrelevant here;\n    precedence decides, so only the `sys.modules[\"tests\"]` pre-bind in\n    `/conftest.py` saves it.\n\n    Confirmed by mutation: with `/conftest.py` reduced to its pre-#64\n    `sys.path.insert(0, repo_root)` body, this fails with\n    `tests.conftest` resolved to the decoy's file.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>The #64 case, and the one measured in the wild (installed wheels<br />\nshipping a top-level <code>tests/</code> package): the decoy carries<br />\n<code>__init__.py</code>, so it is a <em>regular</em> package. <code>PathFinder</code> returns it<br />\nwith a loader and stops walking, throwing away this repo's namespace<br />\nportion -- even though this repo's root is at <code>sys.path[0]</code> and the<br />\ndecoy is behind it on <code>PYTHONPATH</code>. Ordering is irrelevant here;<br />\nprecedence decides, so only the <code>sys.modules[&quot;tests&quot;]</code> pre-bind in<br />\n<code>/conftest.py</code> saves it.</p>\n<pre><code>Confirmed by mutation: with `/conftest.py` reduced to its pre-#64\n`sys.path.insert(0, repo_root)` body, this fails with\n`tests.conftest` resolved to the decoy's file.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesC